<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bond report.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bond report.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonds were edging back from early lows as Italy and Spain improved but volumes were low as traders awaited a clearer direction.</p>
<p>&quot;The market prefers to keep a low profile, particularly as the most liquid bonds are suspended,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
